  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        524.4090576171875,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "screening among people living with HIV, as part of the  Guidelines for intensified tuberculosis case-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4215698242188,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": ",  finding and isoniazid preventive therapy for people living with HIV in resource-constrained settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.3871459960938,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "published in 2011  . WHO recommendations on TB screening among people living with HIV  (33)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4178466796875,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "using CRP, CXR, with the possibility to read the CXR using CAD, and mWRDs were first published in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.445556640625,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "the 2021  WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 2: screening – systematic screening for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.3865966796875,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": ". Therefore, there are now four recommended approaches to TB screening  tuberculosis disease (12)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.443115234375,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "among people living with HIV, namely the W4SS, CRP, CXR (with the possibility of CAD for reading)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        133.48910522460938,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "and mWRDs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.056396484375,
        354.8602600097656,
        214.6313934326172
      ],
      "text": "2.1.2\t Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4222412109375,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "A systematic literature review and individual participant data (IPD) meta-analysis was conducted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.3927001953125,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "in 2020 to review the accuracy of tools for TB screening among adults and adolescents with HIV,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.425537109375,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "including the W4SS, CRP, CXR and mWRDs. Data were analyzed for all study participants, as well",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4199829101562,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "as for five different subpopulations (inpatients, outpatients on ART, outpatients not on ART, people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.4190063476562,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "with CD4 count ≤ 200 cells/µl, and pregnant women living with HIV) where disaggregated data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4146118164062,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "was available. Key findings are summarized below; further details are published in the TB screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        138.51319885253906,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "guidelines  . (12)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.2064208984375,
        522.244384765625,
        353.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1: Systematic screening for TB among people living with HIV at every visit",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.42333984375,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation, which applies to people of all ages, was first published in 2011 in WHO’s",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.4154357910156,
        527.431884765625,
        381.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for intensified tuberculosis case-finding and isoniazid preventive therapy for people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.409912109375,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": ", and it remains in place. The GDG for the development  with HIV in resource-constrained settings (33)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4013671875,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of the 2021 updated WHO guidelines on TB screening placed high value on ensuring that TB is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.392578125,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed early in this risk group, who have a high likelihood of having undetected TB and a high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        444.42919921875,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "risk of poor health outcomes in the absence of early diagnosis and treatment  . (12)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.2064208984375,
        378.83416748046875,
        465.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 2: WHO-recommended four symptom screen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.40234375,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The 2020 IPD meta-analysis included 23 studies of 16 269 participants living with HIV, all of which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.3780517578125,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "reviewed the accuracy of the W4SS. The studies primarily focused on pulmonary TB disease. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.3660278320312,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "unweighted average TB prevalence among participants within these studies was 9.2%, ranging from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4571533203125,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "1% to 26%; and 52% of people living with HIV screened positive on the W4SS. The sensitivity of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        524.3487548828125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "W4SS among all people living with HIV was 83% (95% CI: 74–89) and specificity was 38% (95% CI: 25–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.3867797851562,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "53). Estimates of the accuracy of the W4SS in different subgroups of people living with HIV are shown",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4242553710938,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "in Table 2.1. When used alone, the W4SS was found to have its lowest sensitivity among outpatients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        519.1610717773438,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "on ART and among pregnant women, and it had markedly low specificity among medical inpatients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4454345703125,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "While there may be real-life limitations to the W4SS in terms of consistency that might not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4178466796875,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "reflected in studies, it remains the simplest non-invasive tool to implement in any setting, requiring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4189453125,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "no infrastructure. However, the high proportion of W4SS positivity (94%) and very low specificity in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.402587890625,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "medical inpatients living with HIV in settings where TB prevalence among study participants was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.4168090820312,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "> 10% gives it limited utility as a screening tool to rule in TB prior to diagnostic confirmation by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        220.8313751220703,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "mWRD in this very ill population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.41357421875,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "The IPD meta-analysis found no alternative screening tools or strategies that were significantly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4190673828125,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "higher in both sensitivity and specificity than the W4SS or that met the WHO target product profile",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.4278564453125,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "for a screening test on both parameters. In all cases, when sensitivity was higher and met the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.4188842773438,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "minimal requirements of the target product profile, specificity was compromised, and vice versa.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.3823852539062,
        527.4168701171875,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Depending on a programme’s decision to prioritize higher sensitivity or higher specificity, other tools",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.3823852539062,
        370.4357604980469,
        773.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "or combinations of tools may be used to complement the W4SS.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        46.98609924316406,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "8",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.2599487304688,
        364.234375,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
